Description: bridge from WSL2 ssh client to the Windows ssh-agent
 Listens on a UNIX socket inside WSL2 and forwards agent requests via
 PowerShell.exe to the Windows OpenSSH agent named pipe. Works with any
 agent serving that pipe, e.g. Windows ssh-agent.exe or 1Password.
 .
 Enable per user with: systemctl --user enable --now wsl2-ssh-agent

